First I wash my hands.
Then I fry the Bouletten in a pan.
I fry them until they are dark and crispy.
In the meantime, the potatoes are ready.
I drain the hot water.
Afterwards, I let the potatoes cool down a little.
I peel them.
Then I slice the potatoes into a bowl.
Now I play the last part of the video on my phone.
The chef points directly into the camera.
"Afterwards, mix the cooled potatoes with mayonnaise!" he calls loudly.
I follow this final instruction.
I mix the potatoes with the creamy mayonnaise.
The true Berlin meal is now complete.
The Bouletten and the potato salad look perfect.
